  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Cut tofu into skewer-sized pieces.",
    "3. In a shallow dish, whisk together soy sauce, lime juice, aji amarillo pepper, oregano, garlic, and parsley.",
    "4. Add tofu pieces to the marinade and toss to coat.",
    "5. Let tofu marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "6. Grill tofu for 2-3 minutes per side, or until golden brown.",
    "7. Meanwhile, prepare chimichurri sauce (see below).",
    "8. Serve grilled tofu with chimichurri sauce and red onion garnish."
